Sidebar date filtering. st.sidebar.date_input widgets bound to the observed minimum and
maximum dates filter the frame to a user-selected window. All figures and metrics are computed on the
filtered frame, so every view is internally consistent with the selected period.
Headline metrics. Four metric tiles render the latest in-window values:
Tile Value shown Basis
Total Under Care total_system_load K1
CBP Load Children in CBP custody Stage-1 stock
HHS Load Children in HHS Care Stage-2 stock
