15.4 Known dashboard limitations
Metric tiles read the last row of the filtered frame, which is the last observed date, not the last
calendar date. With 33% of dates absent, a user filtering to a recent window may see a tile value that is
weeks stale without any staleness indicator being shown.
The Q75 high-load threshold computed in Section 12 is not currently rendered in the dashboard, so the
pressure classification of Section 12.4 exists in the analysis but is not yet exposed to users.
load_7d_avg is computed but not visualised.
No caching, no incremental recompute, and a full-frame read on each cold start; at 720 rows this is
immaterial, but the app is not designed for order-of-magnitude-larger data.
